SUMMARY:Jay Jurden LIVE at San Jose Improv
DTSTAMP:20260815T032436Z
DTSTART:20260815T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nJay Jurde
	n is one of the most exciting stand-up comedians working today. His Hulu s
	pecial Yes Ma’am solidifies him as one of the sharpest and most original c
	omedic voices of his generation\, blending deeply personal storytelling wi
	th universally funny observations. \nBased in New York and originally from
	 Mississippi\, Jay has built a reputation for precise writing\, magnetic s
	tage presence\, and a point of view that is both intimate and hilarious. H
	e is a four-time guest on The Tonight Show Starring Jimmy Fallon and has a
	ppeared on The Late Show with Stephen Colbert\, The Late Late Show with Ja
	mes Corden\, Comedy Central Featuring\, and HBO High Maintenance. \nJay se
	rved as a Staff Writer on Apple TV+ Emmy-nominated The Problem with Jon St
	ewart\, and his writing has appeared in The New Yorker\, Vulture\, Teen Vo
	gue\, and McSweeney’s. In 2022\, Variety named him one of their 10 Comics 
	to Watch\, and his debut album Jay Jurden Y’all debuted at number 1 on iTu
	nes. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 15\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00
	 PM PDT (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nAdditional Shows: Sat Aug 15 at 9:30 PM a
	nd Sun Aug 16 at 6:00 PM\nVenue: San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jo
	se\, CA 95113\nAge Restriction: 21+ Event – Valid ID required at the door\
	nContent: Stand-up comedy – sharp\, personal\, and brilliantly crafted\n\n
	About the Venue\nThe San Jose Improv is the Bay Area’s premier stand-up co
	medy destination\, located in the heart of downtown San Jose at 62 S Secon
	d St. Part of the nationally celebrated Improv comedy club chain\, this in
	timate venue has hosted some of the biggest names in comedy and remains Si
	licon Valley’s go-to spot for world-class stand-up. \nThe club’s cozy layo
	ut means every seat feels close to the stage\, creating an electric atmosp
	here that larger theaters simply cannot replicate. The venue features a fu
	ll bar and dining menu\, with a mandatory two-item minimum per guest in th
	e showroom. Seating is general admission and first-come\, first-served exc
	ept for groups and premium booths\, so arriving early is strongly recommen
	ded. \nDowntown San Jose offers plenty of parking garages and easy public 
	transit access nearby. Whether you are a longtime comedy fan or a first-ti
	mer\, the San Jose Improv delivers an unforgettable night out. \nWhat to E
	xpect\nExpect a masterclass in stand-up comedy. Jay Jurden’s live show is 
	a high-precision\, high-energy performance that rewards attentive audience
	s. His material is deeply personal\, drawing from his Southern upbringing\
	, his identity\, and his observations on modern life\, but delivered with 
	a wit and timing that makes it universally relatable. \nThis is a solo hea
	dlining show with no filler. Jay commands the stage with the confidence of
	 a seasoned pro and the freshness of someone who still has plenty to say. 
	Fans of his Hulu special will love seeing this material live\, and there i
	s always new material that has not made it to screen yet. \nThis is a 21+ 
	event. Bring your ID\, enjoy the two-item minimum\, and leave your phone i
	n your pocket. No photography or recording during the show. Just pure\, un
	diluted comedy. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $25 – $75 (plus fees) \
	n\nGA Ticket: $25 (plus fees)\nPremium Banquette (seats 4): $75 (plus fees
	) – includes $200 food and beverage credit\, premium first-tier seating\n\
	nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We m
	ay earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.co
	m/event/jay-jurden-live-at-san-jose-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jay-jurden-live-at-san-jose-improv/
LOCATION:San Jose Improv\, 62 S Second St\, San Jose\, California\, 95113\,
	 United States
