SUMMARY:The Teacher's Lounge: A Comedy Show With Rigor LIVE at The Wilbur
DTSTAMP:20260815T032436Z
DTSTART:20260815T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performers\nThe Teac
	her’s Lounge: A Comedy Show With Rigor is a unique stand-up comedy show fe
	aturing three seasoned educators-turned-comedians: Gaspare Randazzo (Netfl
	ix\, The Social Studies Podcast)\, and fellow teacher-comedians who bring 
	their classroom experiences to the stage in the most hilarious way possibl
	e. \nThese are real teachers who have traded their lesson plans for punchl
	ines — and the result is comedy gold. Drawing from years of experience in 
	the classroom\, they tackle the absurdities of modern education\, student 
	behavior\, parent-teacher conferences\, and the unspoken truths of school 
	life that only educators truly understand. Whether you’re a teacher\, a pa
	rent\, or just someone who survived school\, this show will have you laugh
	ing until it hurts. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 15\, 2026\n
	Time: 7:00 PM\nVenue: The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St\, Boston\, MA 02116\nDoo
	rs Open: Approximately 6:00 PM\nTicket Prices: From $39 (avg. ~$73)\n\nAbo
	ut the Venue\nThe Wilbur is Boston’s premier comedy destination\, located 
	at 246 Tremont Street in the heart of the Theatre District. This beautiful
	ly restored 1\,200-seat historic theater has been hosting world-class come
	dy and entertainment since 1914\, and it remains one of the most beloved v
	enues in New England. \nThe Wilbur offers a warm\, intimate atmosphere wit
	h excellent sightlines from every seat in the house — orchestra\, mezzanin
	e\, and balcony. A full bar is available\, and the venue’s classic archite
	cture adds a special ambiance to every performance. The theater is conveni
	ently located near the MBTA Boylston and Back Bay stations\, with multiple
	 parking garages nearby on Tremont and Stuart Streets. \nWhat to Expect\nT
	he Teacher’s Lounge is a multi-comedian lineup show featuring some of the 
	funniest educators in comedy today. Expect a night of relatable\, sharp\, 
	and brilliantly observed humor about the world of teaching — from the chao
	s of the classroom to the politics of the faculty lounge. This is comedy t
	hat celebrates teachers while roasting the entire education system with lo
	ve and laughter. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes and is perfect f
	or teachers\, school staff\, parents\, and anyone who appreciates smart\, 
	well-crafted comedy. Grab your tickets early — this unique concept show is
	 generating serious buzz and seats are limited at The Wilbur. \nTicket Inf
	ormation\nTicket Prices: From $39 (average ~$73) \nSecure your seats throu
	gh official Ticketmaster channels or find resale tickets through VividSeat
	s: \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. 
	We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalenda
	r.com/event/the-teachers-lounge-a-comedy-show-with-rigor-live-at-the-wilbu
	r/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/the-teachers-lounge-a-comedy-show-with
	-rigor-live-at-the-wilbur/
LOCATION:The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St.\, Boston\, MA\, 2116
