DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nJosué Comedy is a rising star in the Spanish-language comedy world\, 
	known for his sharp wit\, relatable storytelling\, and ability to connect 
	deeply with Latino audiences across the United States and Latin America. \
	nHis show Madre Latina: Peligrosa\, Pero Divina is a love letter to the ic
	onic Latina mother — fierce\, funny\, and unforgettable. Josué’s comedy bl
	ends personal anecdotes\, cultural observations\, and universal family hum
	or that resonates with anyone who grew up in a Latino household. \nWith a 
	growing social media following and sold-out shows across the country\, Jos
	ué Comedy is quickly becoming one of the most exciting voices in bilingual
	 stand-up comedy. His performances are known for being warm\, hilarious\, 
	and deeply heartfelt. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 15\, 2026
	\nTime: 8:00 PM CDT\nVenue: Wilson Theater at Vogel Hall\, 121 E. Wells St
	.\, Milwaukee\, WI 53202\nShow Language: Primarily Spanish with bilingual 
	elements\nContent Warning: Adult themes and language — recommended for age
	s 18+\n\nAbout the Venue\nWilson Theater at Vogel Hall is part of the Marc
	us Performing Arts Center\, one of Milwaukee’s most beloved cultural insti
	tutions. Located at 121 E. Wells St. in the heart of downtown Milwaukee\, 
	the Wilson Theater is an intimate and elegant venue with a capacity of app
	roximately 500 seats. \nThe theater features excellent acoustics\, comfort
	able seating\, and a warm\, inviting atmosphere that makes it perfect for 
	comedy performances. The Marcus Center complex is easily accessible from d
	owntown Milwaukee and offers nearby parking in the Milwaukee Center Parkin
	g structure. \nThe Wilson Theater’s intimate setting means every seat feel
	s close to the stage\, creating a personal and immersive experience for co
	medy fans. The venue’s classic design and professional production capabili
	ties ensure a top-tier show experience. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo s
	tand-up comedy show featuring Josué Comedy performing his full-length spec
	ial Madre Latina: Peligrosa\, Pero Divina. Expect a night of heartfelt lau
	ghs\, cultural celebration\, and stories about the Latina mother experienc
	e that will have the entire audience in stitches. \nThe show is primarily 
	in Spanish\, making it a wonderful event for Spanish-speaking audiences an
	d bilingual comedy fans. Whether you’re a longtime fan of Josué Comedy or 
	discovering him for the first time\, this is a must-see performance. \nArr
	ive early to find your seats and enjoy the intimate atmosphere of the Wils
	on Theater before the show begins. This is a seated theater event\, so exp
	ect a more relaxed and focused comedy experience. \nTicket Information\nPr
	ice Range: From $52.40 (standard tickets) \nTickets are available through 
	Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). This show is expected to 
	be popular with Milwaukee’s Latino community\, so purchase early to secure
	 your seats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.co
	m/event/madre-latina-peligrosa-pero-divina-de-josue-comedy-live-at-wilson-
	theater-at-vogel-hall/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/madre-latina-peligrosa-pero-divina-de-
	josue-comedy-live-at-wilson-theater-at-vogel-hall/
