SUMMARY:Josh Johnson's Comedy Band Camp LIVE at Orpheum Theatre (Sat)
DTSTAMP:20260815T032436Z
DTSTART:20260815T203000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nJosh John
	son is a rising star in the stand-up comedy world\, best known for his sha
	rp wit\, incisive social commentary\, and effortlessly cool stage presence
	. A regular on The Daily Show and a Netflix special veteran\, Johnson has 
	built a devoted following with his ability to tackle complex topics — race
	\, culture\, politics — with disarming humor and intelligence. \nHis 2026 
	tour\, Comedy Band Camp\, is a unique and ambitious live experience that b
	lends stand-up comedy with live musical performance. Johnson brings togeth
	er a full band to create a show unlike anything else on the comedy circuit
	 — part concert\, part comedy special\, all entertainment. \nFans can expe
	ct Johnson’s signature blend of observational humor\, cultural critique\, 
	and storytelling\, all elevated by a live musical backdrop that adds energ
	y and spontaneity to every performance. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\
	, August 15\, 2026\nTime: 8:30 PM CDT\nVenue: Orpheum Theatre\, 910 Hennep
	in Avenue\, Minneapolis\, MN 55403\nTicket Price Range: $39 – $125\nAge Re
	strictions: All ages welcome\; some content may be intended for mature aud
	iences\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Orpheum Theatre is one of Minneapolis’s mos
	t iconic and beloved performance venues. Located in the heart of the Henne
	pin Theatre District at 910 Hennepin Avenue\, this stunning 2\,600-seat hi
	storic theater has been a cornerstone of Twin Cities entertainment since 1
	921. \nThe Orpheum features ornate architecture\, plush seating\, excellen
	t sightlines from virtually every seat\, and world-class acoustics — makin
	g it the perfect setting for a show that combines comedy and live music. T
	he venue offers a full bar\, concessions\, and accessible seating options 
	throughout. \nParking is available in several nearby ramps and surface lot
	s along Hennepin Avenue and in the surrounding downtown Minneapolis area. 
	The venue is also easily accessible via Metro Transit light rail. \nWhat t
	o Expect\nJosh Johnson’s Comedy Band Camp is not your typical stand-up sho
	w. This is a full-scale live event featuring Johnson performing alongside 
	a live band\, creating a dynamic and immersive comedy experience that blur
	s the line between concert and comedy special. \nExpect high-energy perfor
	mances\, crowd interaction\, and the kind of sharp\, culturally aware humo
	r that has made Johnson one of the most talked-about comedians of his gene
	ration. The Saturday late show at the Orpheum promises an electric atmosph
	ere. \nThis is a rare opportunity to see Josh Johnson in one of Minneapoli
	s’s most prestigious venues — don’t miss it. \nTicket Information\nTickets
	 range from $39 to $125 depending on seat location. Purchase official tick
	ets directly through Ticketmaster or find resale tickets through VividSeat
	s. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. 
	We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalenda
	r.com/event/josh-johnsons-comedy-band-camp-live-at-orpheum-theatre-sat/\n\
	nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/josh-johnsons-comedy-band-camp-live-at
	-orpheum-theatre-sat/
