SUMMARY:Peter Antoniou LIVE at Punch Line Philly
DTSTAMP:20260815T032436Z
DTSTART:20260816T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nPeter Ant
	oniou is a rising star in the world of stand-up comedy\, known for his exp
	losive energy\, razor-sharp wit\, and fearlessly honest material. The Aust
	ralian-born comedian has quickly made a name for himself on the internatio
	nal comedy circuit\, winning over audiences with his unique perspective on
	 culture\, identity\, and the absurdities of everyday life. \nAntoniou’s c
	omedy is bold\, fast-paced\, and deeply personal. He draws from his multic
	ultural background and life experiences to craft material that is both hil
	arious and surprisingly insightful. His performances are known for their i
	ntensity and authenticity — he holds nothing back on stage\, and audiences
	 love him for it. \nHaving toured extensively across Australia\, the UK\, 
	and North America\, Peter Antoniou is building a reputation as one of the 
	most exciting live performers in comedy today. His Philadelphia debut at P
	unch Line Philly is not to be missed. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, Augu
	st 16\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM EDT \nVenue: Punch Line Philly — 33 E. Laurel
	 Street\, Philadelphia\, PA 19123 \nAge Restriction: 21+ with 2-beverage m
	inimum \nTicket Prices: Starting from $27 (plus fees) \nAbout the Venue\nP
	unch Line Philly is the crown jewel of Philadelphia’s comedy scene\, locat
	ed at 33 E. Laurel Street in the Northern Liberties neighborhood. With a c
	apacity of approximately 300 guests\, the club offers an intimate setting 
	where every seat feels close to the stage. \nThe venue boasts a full bar\,
	 comfortable table seating\, and a vibrant atmosphere that gets the crowd 
	energized before the first comedian even takes the mic. The sound system a
	nd lighting are top-notch\, ensuring a professional\, polished show experi
	ence every time. \nPunch Line Philly is accessible by public transit and h
	as parking available in nearby garages and lots. Doors open 30–45 minutes 
	before showtime — plan to arrive early to grab your drinks and find your s
	eats before the show begins. \nWhat to Expect\nPeter Antoniou brings an el
	ectric\, high-octane energy to the stage that is impossible to ignore. His
	 set is a whirlwind of sharp observations\, personal stories\, and fearles
	s comedy that keeps the audience on the edge of their seats — and in stitc
	hes throughout. \nThe evening will feature an opening act followed by Pete
	r Antoniou’s full headlining performance. Whether you’re already a fan or 
	experiencing his comedy for the first time\, this is a show that will leav
	e a lasting impression. \nThis is a 21+ event with a two-beverage minimum.
	 Tickets are on sale now — grab yours before this intimate show sells out.
	 \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $27 – $60 (plus fees) \nTickets are av
	ailable through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). Don’t mis
	s out! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate lin
	ks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycal
	endar.com/event/peter-antoniou-live-at-punch-line-philly/\n\nFrom Comedy C
	alendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/peter-antoniou-live-at-punch-line-phil
	ly/
LOCATION:Punch Line Philly\, 33 E. Laurel Street\, Philadelphia\, PA\, 1912
	3\, United States
