DTSTAMP:20260815T032437Z
DTSTART:20260816T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nNurse John: Special L
	ive Taping LIVE at Alex Theatre\nNurse John is coming to the Alex Theatre 
	in Glendale for a very special occasion — the live taping of his first sta
	nd-up comedy special. \nThis is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to be par
	t of comedy history as Nurse John films his debut special in front of a li
	ve audience. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 16\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00
	 PM PDT \nVenue: Alex Theatre \nAddress: 216 North Brand Boulevard\, Glend
	ale\, CA 91203 \nAge Requirement: All ages welcome \nAbout Nurse John\nNur
	se John is a rising star in stand-up comedy who has built a massive follow
	ing through his relatable\, high-energy performances. Known for his sharp 
	wit and unique perspective as a healthcare professional turned comedian\, 
	he has quickly become one of the most talked-about voices in comedy. \nThi
	s special live taping marks a major milestone in his career. \nWhat to Exp
	ect\n\nThe live taping of Nurse John’s first stand-up comedy special\nHigh
	-energy stand-up comedy in an intimate theater setting\nA historic night —
	 be part of the audience for his debut special\nThe beautiful Alex Theatre
	 in Glendale\, one of LA’s most beloved venues\nAn unforgettable evening o
	f laughs you’ll be able to say you were there for\n\nVenue Information\nTh
