DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nJon Lovitz LIVE at Bethesda Theater\nComedy legend
	 Jon Lovitz is bringing his hilarious stand-up act to the Bethesda Theater
	 on August 16\, 2026. Known for his iconic characters and razor-sharp wit\
	, Lovitz delivers a night of non-stop laughs that fans of all ages will lo
	ve. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 16\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM ET\nVe
	nue: Bethesda Theater\nAddress: 7719 Wisconsin Ave\, Bethesda\, MD 20814\n
	Phone: (240) 330-4500\nAge Requirement: Check venue for details \nAbout Jo
	n Lovitz\nJon Lovitz is a beloved comedian and actor best known for his ye
	ars on Saturday Night Live\, where he created iconic characters like Tommy
	 Flanagan the Pathological Liar and Master Thespian. He has appeared in do
	zens of films and TV shows and continues to tour as one of America’s most 
	recognizable stand-up comedians. His sharp observational humor and impecca
	ble timing make every show a memorable experience. \nWhat to Expect\n\nCla
	ssic stand-up comedy from an SNL legend\nHilarious storytelling and charac
	ter work\nSharp wit and observational humor\nCallbacks to beloved TV and f
	ilm roles\nAn intimate theater setting for a premium comedy experience\nA 
	night of non-stop laughter\n\nVenue Information\nBethesda Theater is a pre
	mier entertainment venue located at 7719 Wisconsin Ave in Bethesda\, MD\, 
	offering excellent sightlines and a comfortable atmosphere for live comedy
	 and performances. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $109. Secure you
	r seats now — Jon Lovitz shows sell out fast! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale T
	ickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you p
	urchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are
